Description: Firmware for HiFiBerry Studio sound card microcontrollers
 Prebuilt firmware binaries for the microcontrollers on HiFiBerry Studio
 sound cards, plus a helper to flash them over UPDI using pymcuprog.
 .
 Currently ships the Studio DAC8x firmware (v0.0.3). The firmware turns the
 on-board microcontroller into an I2C controller (address 0x10) that presents the
 universal sound-card register map used by the driver to configure the card.
